2026-07-22T14:42:24.9571885Z     Features
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9572083Z     --------
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9572267Z     
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9572966Z     - Detailed info on failing `assert statements <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/assert.html>`_ (no need to remember ``self.assert*`` names)
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9573606Z     
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9573793Z     - `Auto-discovery
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9574225Z       <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/explanation/goodpractices.html#python-test-discovery>`_
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9574845Z       of test modules and functions
