2026-07-22T14:42:24.9575980Z       managing small or parametrized long-lived test resources
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9576305Z     
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9576653Z     - Can run `unittest <https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/how-to/unittest.html>`_ (or trial)
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9577106Z       test suites out of the box
2026-07-22T14:42:24.9577343Z     
